---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy — Fabio Steyer"
  description="Privacy information."
  altHref="/datenschutz"
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>

  <div class="beleg-fehlt mt-6">
    <strong>DRAFT, NOT REVIEWED.</strong> The text below describes the technical state of this
    site. It is not a reviewed privacy policy and must be completed before publication.
  </div>

  <section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="technical">
    <h2 id="technical" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Technical state of this site</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>Fully static site. No backend, no database, no contact form.</li>
      <li>No cookies, no tracking, no analytics, no social media embeds.</li>
      <li>No external fonts. System fonts only.</li>
      <li>No third-party scripts or stylesheets.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="hosting">
    <h2 id="hosting" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hosting</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      The site is served by GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc. On each request the provider
      processes technically necessary connection data, including the IP address. I have no
      influence over the scope or retention of that processing.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-muted)">
      The German version of this page is authoritative.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
